@@ -0,0 +1,306 @@
+# -*- coding:utf-8 -*-
+# Copyright (c) 2020 Huawei Technologies Co.,Ltd.
+#
+# openGauss is licensed under Mulan PSL v2.
+# You can use this software according to the terms
+# and conditions of the Mulan PSL v2.
